<main class="sayori-home">
    <section class="sayori-section pt-16 lg:pt-24">
        <div class="max-w-[1180px] mx-auto px-5">
            <p class="hero-eyebrow">CATEGORY</p>
            <h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(3rem,8vw,5.5rem)] leading-[0.92] mt-4">
                SimpleFun:
                <span class="text-[#FFD34E]">
                    Single Player
                </span>
            </h1>

            <p class="hero-description mt-6 max-w-2xl">
                A lot of different types of games, which we were not able to fit in any other category.
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-12">

                <div class="game-stat bg-[#562447]">
                    <span>Games</span>
                    <strong>2</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="game-stat bg-[#562447]">
                    <span>Players</span>
                    <strong>1</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="game-stat bg-[#562447]">
                    <span>Commands</span>
                    <strong>2</strong>
                </div>

                <div class="game-stat bg-[#562447]">
                    <span>Status</span>
                    <strong>Active</strong>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Sidebar -->
    <aside class="hidden lg:block">
        <div class="sticky top-8">
            <div class="sidebar-card bg-[#562447]">
                <p class="section-kicker">Games</p>
                <nav class="mt-6 space-y-2">
                    <a href="#blackjack" class="sidebar-link hover:bg-[#6A2E58] hover:text-[#FFD34E]">
                        🃏Blackjack
                    </a>
                    <a href="#minesweeper" class="sidebar-link hover:bg-[#6A2E58] hover:text-[#FFD34E]">
                        💥Minesweeper
                    </a>
                    <a href="#coming-soon" class="sidebar-link hover:text-[#FFD34E]">
                        ＋ More Coming Soon
                    </a>
                </nav>
                <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-[var(--sayori-border)]">

                    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        Need a specific command?
                    </p>
                    <a href="?explore" class="sayori-btn mt-4">
                        📖 Gamebook
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="hidden lg:block min-h-[8px]"></div>

    <!-- Only visible on mobile -->
    <div class="lg:hidden mb-10 max-w-[99vw]">
        <select
            class="w-[99vw] max-w-[99vw] bg-[#562447] border border-[var(--sayori-border)] rounded-xl p-4 text-[var(--sayori-text)]"
            onchange="location.hash=this.value">
            <option value="">Browse Games</option>
            <option value="blackjack"> 🃏Blackjack </option>
            <option value="minesweeper"> 💥Minesweeper </option>
        </select>
    </div>
    <div>

        <section id="blackjack"
            class="game-card rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-[#562447] border border-[var(--sayori-border)]">
            <header class="card-header px-8 py-12">
                <div class="card-symbol">
                    🃏
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl text-[var(--sayori-lavender-bright)]">Blackjack</h2>
                <p class="card-tagline">
                    Classic card thing.
                </p>
            </header>

            <div class="px-8 pb-8 space-y-10">
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">🎮 How to Play</h3>
                    <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] leading-8">
                        Dealer deals the card and you get two cards. Now dealer will only reveal one card to you. The
                        goal of the game is to reach 21 or be closer to 21. Having a number higher than 21 will make you
                        lose automatically.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="space-y-3 text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        <li>- Pressing hit will give you a card from the deck.</li>
                        <li>- Double fold is forfeit.</li>
                        <li>- Pressing stand means you do not wish to draw any new card and whatever cards you have
                            currently is your final cards.</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
                <section>

                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">⌨ Commands</h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                        <button class="copy-command p-2 rounded" data-command="/blackjack">
                            /blackjack
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </section>
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold"> Important stuffs:</h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-3 text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        <li>- Value of face cards is 10.</li>
                        <li>- Value of Ace is 1.</li>
                        <li>- The one closer to 21 wins.</li>
                        <li>- If you cross 21 then you lose..</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold"> Tips:</h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-3 text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        <li>- If the value of your cards is more than 15, do not press hit... Most of the times it's a
                            bad choice.</li>
                        <li>- Press hit when the values is really small.</li>
                        <li>- Most of the time, it is safe to press 'stand' when you have 17 or higher.</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
            </div>
        </section>
        <div class="min-h-[3px]"></div>
        <section id="minesweeper"
            class="game-card rounded-3xl overflow-hidden bg-[#562447] border border-[var(--sayori-border)]">
            <header class="card-header px-8 py-12">
                <div class="card-symbol">
                    💥
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl text-[var(--sayori-lavender-bright)]">Minesweeper</h2>
                <p class="card-tagline">
                    Nostalgiaaaaa...
                </p>
            </header>

            <div class="px-8 pb-8 space-y-10">
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">
                        🎮 How to Play
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] leading-8">
                        Your goal is to reveal every safe tile without clicking on a mine. Whenever you reveal a safe
                        tile, it may display a number. That number tells you how many mines exist in the eight tiles
                        surrounding it. If no number, you can press every box around it without fear, Wohoo.
                    </p>
                    <ul class="space-y-3 text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        <li>- A tile showing <strong>1</strong> means exactly one nearby tile contains a mine.</li>
                        <li>- A tile showing <strong>2</strong> means exactly two nearby tiles contain mines.</li>
                        <li>- Use those numbers to figure out which tiles are safe.</li>
                        <li>- Clicking on a mine ends the game immediately.</li>
                        <li>- Empty box, click everything around it.</li>
                    </ul>

                </section>
                <section>

                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold mb-4">⌨ Commands</h3>
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
                        <button class="copy-command p-2 rounded" data-command="/minesweeper">
                            /minesweeper
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </section>
                <section>
                    <h3 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xl font-semibold"> Tips </h3>
                    <ul class="space-y-3 text-[var(--sayori-muted)]">
                        <li>- Start from a corner or edge whenever possible.</li>
                        <li>- A tile marked <strong>1</strong> means exactly one surrounding tile contains a mine.</li>
                        <li>- Empty spaces reveal large safe areas automatically, so use them to gather information.
                        </li>
                        <li>- Don't guess unless every logical move has been exhausted.</li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
            </div>
        </section>

    </div>
    <div class="min-h-[6px]"></div>

    <section id="coming-soon" class="mt-16 p-2">
        <p class="section-kicker">
            More Games
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl mt-3">
            Coming Soon
        </h2>
        <p class="hero-description mt-4 max-w-2xl">
            Nothing hurts in giving a sneak peek.
        </p>
        <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3 mt-10">
            <article
                class="rounded-3xl p-6 bg-[#562447] border border-dashed border-[var(--sayori-border)] transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-[var(--sayori-lavender)] cursor-pointer">
                <span
                    class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase bg-[rgba(185,163,230,.08)] text-[var(--sayori-orange)]">
                    Form
                </span>
                <h3 class="font-serif text-3xl mt-5">
                    Do you have a cool guessing game idea?
                </h3>
                <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] leading-8 mt-4">
                    Drop your ideas in the form provided.
                </p>
                <p class="text-[var(--sayori-muted)] leading-8 mt-4">
                    To be honest, could there be any single player game which can be added? Is there anything?
                </p>
                <a class="sayori-btn sayori-btn-secondary bg-[#FFD34E] text-black"
                    href="https://forms.gle/w36x89tjFFxE32rY8 ">Form!</a>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

</main>